// Orion: every LLM call during one chapter's extraction, in order (Sequence diagram).
// Paste into eraser.io -> "Diagram as code" -> Sequence diagram.
// Code: backend/app/pipeline/extractor.py, extractor/extractor/{pipeline,events,relations,llm}.py

title LLM call sequence for one chapter
autoNumber on

Job runner [icon: list, color: purple]
Extractor client [icon: send, color: blue]
CLI [icon: terminal, color: orange]
Pipeline [icon: layers, color: orange]
Encoders [icon: box, color: green]
llm generate [icon: code, color: orange]
Ollama [icon: cpu, color: orange]
Grounding [icon: shield, color: gray]

Job runner > Extractor client: extract_chapter(text + chapter_number)
Extractor client > CLI: subprocess python -m extractor run IN.txt OUT.json
CLI > Pipeline: extract(story_id + text)

// GPU handoff: one 6 GB card holds the encoders or the LLM, never both
Pipeline > Ollama: release_llm - GET /api/ps
Pipeline > Ollama: POST /api/generate keep_alive 0 for every loaded model

Pipeline > Encoders: mentions / coref / events / temporal (no LLM)
Encoders > Pipeline: mentions + clusters + events + temporal lists
Pipeline > Encoders: release_encoders - cache_clear + cuda.empty_cache

opt [label: ORION_EVENT_LLM set - off by default, color: gray] {
  loop [label: each sentence with triggers] {
    Pipeline > llm generate: TYPING_SYSTEM + sentence with T1 / T2 marks; schema = one EVENT_TYPES enum per trigger
    llm generate > Ollama: POST /api/chat model ORION_EVENT_LLM; temp 0; num_ctx 4096; num_predict 512
    Ollama > llm generate: JSON object (constrained to the schema)
    llm generate > Pipeline: T1 = type ...; retype those events
  }
}

Pipeline > Pipeline: role_pairs + title_facts (spaCy rules; no LLM)

loop [label: each 2000-char chunk with character or organization mentions, color: orange] {
  Pipeline > llm generate: NuExtract layout - Template people + worked Example + Context chunk
  llm generate > Ollama: POST /api/chat model nuextract2-4b; format json; temp 0; num_predict 1024
  Ollama > llm generate: people with name + 11 verbatim fact properties
  alt [label: done_reason = length, color: red] {
    llm generate > Pipeline: RuntimeError - reply cut off (chapter fails)
  }
  llm generate > Grounding: people JSON
  Grounding > Grounding: name is a chunk mention; value is in chunk; at most 40 chars; color / digit / occupation checks
  Grounding > Pipeline: facts (deduped per entity + property + value)

  Pipeline > llm generate: Template relationships (subject / relation enum / object / evidence) + Example + Context
  llm generate > Ollama: POST /api/chat model nuextract2-4b; format json
  Ollama > llm generate: relationships JSON
  llm generate > Grounding: relationships JSON
  Grounding > Grounding: both ends are mentions; evidence is a quote naming both + a cue word; no self
  Grounding > Pipeline: relationships (canonical form; deduped)
}

Pipeline > Ollama: release_llm - keep_alive 0 (GPU back for the next chapter)
Pipeline > Pipeline: schema_errors vs orion_gold_v1
Pipeline > CLI: gold document (or ValueError)
CLI > Extractor client: OUT.json or error (exit code)
Extractor client > Job runner: to_legacy dict then integrate in one transaction
